WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:07.380
iFranchise is a franchise consultancy based in Bengaluru, working
with investors and business owners across India.

2
00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:13.340
Our work covers franchise selection, model development, partner
information, and expansion planning.

3
00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:22.380
For investors, the process starts with your requirements: your
budget, preferred city, interests, and how involved you want to be
in daily operations.

4
00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:26.700
From there, suitable opportunities can be shortlisted for
discussion.

5
00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:33.540
A familiar brand name is only one part of the decision; the business
model and your circumstances matter too.

6
00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:38.820
Review the complete investment, including setup costs, fees, and
working capital.

7
00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.180
Understand who operates the outlet, what support is offered, and
which responsibilities remain with you.

8
00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:49.740
Ask the brand for relevant information and clarify the commercial
terms.

9
00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:59.140
Before committing, arrange independent legal and financial advice
and review the agreement carefully. Business outcomes are never
guaranteed.

10
00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:03.380
For business owners, franchising begins with readiness.

11
00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:12.220
Consider whether your economics, operating processes, and customer
experience can be repeated consistently beyond your existing
locations.

12
00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:20.380
The next step is to define the proposed franchise model, territory
approach, partner responsibilities, and support.

13
00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:26.100
These decisions shape the information a prospective franchisee needs
to understand.

14
00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:32.340
A clear partner profile and an informative brand listing help start
relevant conversations.

15
00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:38.140
Enquiries can then be discussed against the brand's requirements,
rather than judged by interest alone.

16
00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:44.540
Training, launch preparation, and ongoing support should be
considered from the beginning.

17
00:01:44.740 --> 00:01:51.300
Document the handovers and expectations so both sides understand how
the relationship is intended to work.

18
00:01:51.780 --> 00:01:58.100
Throughout the process, iFranchise helps bring investor and brand
discussions together, with clear next steps.

19
00:01:58.300 --> 00:02:02.620
We agree the consulting scope around your business and the
preparation you need.

20
00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:09.820
Visit iFranchise dot in to explore franchise opportunities, read
practical guides, or list your brand.

21
00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:12.500
Contact our team to discuss your requirements.

